    triage:description "TASK-1244 replaced yield_now() with sleep(Duration::from_millis(5)) in test_support.rs:91 inside connect_daemon_local_ipc_until_ready(). The §4.1 anti-flake contract in docs/phase-S/plan-phase-S.md requires that any approved use of sleep() in tests be listed as a named exception with rationale. No such entry was added for connect_daemon_local_ipc_until_ready. Fix: add an exception entry to docs/phase-S/plan-phase-S.md §4.1 naming connect_daemon_local_ipc_until_ready and explaining the rationale (polling helper needs a fixed backoff interval; yield_now() provides no delay guarantee)." ;
